{"type": "user", "message": {"role": "user", "content": [{"tool_use_id": "toolu_017VFUhtavTptF9RHBZN6Uya", "type": "tool_result", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "{\"excerpt_removed\": true, \"references\": [{\"url\": \"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Apollo_13\"}, {\"url\": \"https://www.wikipedia.org/wiki/Apollo13\"}, {\"url\": \"https://spacefacts.de/mission/english/apollo-13.htm\"}, {\"url\": \"https://irc.astro.univie.ac.at/kiwix/content/wikipedia_en_100_2023-11/A/Apollo_13\"}, {\"url\": \"https://www.nasa.gov/history/afj/ap13fj/01launch_ascent.html\"}, {\"url\": \"https://api.nextspaceflight.com/launches/details/195\"}, {\"url\": \"https://api.spacelaunchnow.me/launch/saturn-v-apollo-13\"}, {\"url\": \"https://spaceodysseyhub.com/missions/apollo-13\"}, {\"url\": \"https://simple.wikipedia.com/wiki/Apollo_13\"}, {\"url\": \"https://orbitcodex.com/operations/apollo-13-saturn-v\"}]}"}]}]}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "timestamp": "2026-10-20T13:01:26.567Z", "tool_use_result": {"query": "Apollo 13 launch mass kg Wikipedia", "results": [{"tool_use_id": "srvtoolu_01UnNZzWsSoCo13vFnLNrz7Y", "content": [{"title": "Apollo 13", "url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Apollo_13"}, {"title": "www.wikipedia.org", "url": "https://www.wikipedia.org/wiki/Apollo13"}, {"title": "Human Spaceflights to the Moon", "url": "https://spacefacts.de/mission/english/apollo-13.htm"}, {"title": "Apollo 13", "url": "https://irc.astro.univie.ac.at/kiwix/content/wikipedia_en_100_2023-11/A/Apollo_13"}, {"title": "Apollo Flight Journal logo", "url": "https://www.nasa.gov/history/afj/ap13fj/01launch_ascent.html"}, {"title": "NEXT SPACEFLIGHT", "url": "https://api.nextspaceflight.com/launches/details/195"}, {"title": "Watch the Launch", "url": "https://api.spacelaunchnow.me/launch/saturn-v-apollo-13"}, {"title": "apollo 13", "url": "https://spaceodysseyhub.com/missions/apollo-13"}, {"title": "Apollo 13", "url": "https://simple.wikipedia.com/wiki/Apollo_13"}, {"title": "apollo 13 saturn v", "url": "https://orbitcodex.com/operations/apollo-13-saturn-v"}]}, "The English Wikipedia infobox gives a launch mass of 44,069 kg, split into 28,881 kg for the command/service module and 15,188 kg for the lunar module. Launch mass | 44,069 kg (CSM: 28,881 kg;[3] LM: 15,188 kg)[4]\n\nOther sources give different figures:\n- **Simple English Wikipedia** lists 45,931 kg (101,261 lb), which is noticeably higher than the main article. Launch mass | 101,261 pounds (45,931 kg)\n- **spaceodysseyhub.com** gives about 43,500 kg for the combined CSM and LM. Mass | ~43,500 kg (CSM + LM combined)\n- **Orbit Codex** puts the CSM at roughly 30,300 kg and the LM at about 15,200 kg. The CSM had a mass of approximately 30,300 kg\n- **NASA's Apollo Flight Journal** covers the whole fully fuelled stack, not just the spacecraft. It states its mass stands at 2,949,136 kilograms, or 6,501,733 pounds.\n\nThe Wikipedia figure of 44,069 kg is the most likely answer to your query. The differences likely reflect whether the figure includes the fuel, the adapter, or the lunar module's propellant, but the sources don't say which. The whole-rocket figure of about 2.95 million kg is a different quantity."], "durationSeconds": 7.247470291999999, "searchCount": 1}, "tool_result_meta": [{"id": "toolu_017VFUhtavTptF9RHBZN6Uya", "permission_decision": {"decision": "accept", "source": "hook", "reason_type": "hook"}}]}
{"type": "user", "message": {"role": "user", "content": [{"tool_use_id": "toolu_01LnXeJj1mw88hE7AH17vkNa", "type": "tool_result", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "{\"excerpt_removed\": true, \"references\": [{\"url\": \"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Apollo_12\"}, {\"url\": \"https://spacefacts.de/mission/english/apollo-12.htm\"}, {\"url\": \"https://satnow.com/space-mission-details/nasa/apollo-12\"}, {\"url\": \"https://bafybeiemxf5abjwjbikoz4mc3a3dla6ual3jsgpdr4cjr3oz3evfyavhwq.ipfs.4everland.io/wiki/Apollo_12.html\"}, {\"url\": \"https://api.nextspaceflight.com/launches/details/194\"}, {\"url\": \"https://outrocket.com/rocket-launch/usa/1969/saturn-apollo-12\"}, {\"url\": \"https://en.wikipedia.com/wiki/Apollo_12\"}, {\"url\": \"https://spaceodysseyhub.com/missions/apollo-12\"}, {\"url\": \"https://he.wikipedia.org@en.wikipedia.com/wiki/Apollo_12\"}, {\"url\": \"https://orbitcodex.com/operations/apollo-12-saturn-v\"}]}"}]}]}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "timestamp": "2026-10-20T13:01:26.981Z", "tool_use_result": {"query": "Apollo 12 launch mass kg Wikipedia", "results": [{"tool_use_id": "srvtoolu_01Lu1JEkUeS3t8MLtaNxtBwt", "content": [{"title": "Apollo 12", "url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Apollo_12"}, {"title": "Human Spaceflights to the Moon", "url": "https://spacefacts.de/mission/english/apollo-12.htm"}, {"title": "apollo 12", "url": "https://satnow.com/space-mission-details/nasa/apollo-12"}, {"title": "Apollo 12", "url": "https://bafybeiemxf5abjwjbikoz4mc3a3dla6ual3jsgpdr4cjr3oz3evfyavhwq.ipfs.4everland.io/wiki/Apollo_12.html"}, {"title": "NEXT SPACEFLIGHT", "url": "https://api.nextspaceflight.com/launches/details/194"}, {"title": "saturn apollo 12", "url": "https://outrocket.com/rocket-launch/usa/1969/saturn-apollo-12"}, {"title": "Apollo 12", "url": "https://en.wikipedia.com/wiki/Apollo_12"}, {"title": "apollo 12", "url": "https://spaceodysseyhub.com/missions/apollo-12"}, {"title": "Apollo 12", "url": "https://he.wikipedia.org@en.wikipedia.com/wiki/Apollo_12"}, {"title": "apollo 12 saturn v", "url": "https://orbitcodex.com/operations/apollo-12-saturn-v"}]}, "The Wikipedia results give a launch mass of 49,915 kg (110,044 lb) for the Apollo 12 spacecraft. An older Wikipedia mirror lists 45,870 kg (101,127 lb) for the same field, so the figures differ across versions. The current en.wikipedia.org infobox lists launch mass as 49,915 kg (110,044 lb), and the en.wikipedia.com version gives the same 49,915 kg figure, with a source note.\n\nOther sites report different numbers:\n- Outrocket and Next Spaceflight give a total payload mass of 45,870 kg.\n- Orbit Codex gives the command module's launch mass as 49,915 kg and the lunar module's as 15,200 kg.\n- Spaceodyssey Hub gives a combined CSM and LM mass of about 43,700 kg.\n- Satnow lists 28,790 kg, which looks like a mismatch with the other sources.\n\nThe most consistent answer for the full stack is about 49,915 kg, per the current Wikipedia infobox. The 45,870 kg figure appears to be a total from payload-mass listings."], "durationSeconds": 7.9280557499999995, "searchCount": 1}, "tool_result_meta": [{"id": "toolu_01LnXeJj1mw88hE7AH17vkNa", "permission_decision": {"decision": "accept", "source": "hook", "reason_type": "hook"}}]}
{"type": "user", "message": {"role": "user", "content": [{"tool_use_id": "toolu_013me9feodTgkgkrTd9qo6i4", "type": "tool_result", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "{\"excerpt_removed\": true, \"references\": [{\"url\": \"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Apollo_11\"}, {\"url\": \"https://www.wikipedia.com/wiki/Apolo_11\"}, {\"url\": \"https://solarspell-dls.sfis.asu.edu/mea/wikipedia/wp/a/Apollo_11.htm\"}, {\"url\": \"https://kolibri.teacherinabox.org.au/modules/en-wikipedia_for_schools-static/wp/a/Apollo_11.htm\"}, {\"url\": \"https://api.nextspaceflight.com/launches/details/193\"}, {\"url\": \"https://www.slideshare.net/slideshow/apollo-11-115193652/115193652\"}, {\"url\": \"https://www.thisdayinaviation.com/tag/launch-complex-39a/page/5/\"}, {\"url\": \"https://simple.wikipedia.com/wiki/Apollo_11\"}, {\"url\": \"https://orbitcodex.com/operations/apollo-11-saturn-v\"}, {\"url\": \"https://spaceodysseyhub.com/missions/apollo-11\"}]}"}]}]}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "timestamp": "2026-10-20T13:01:27.735Z", "tool_use_result": {"query": "Apollo 11 launch mass kg Wikipedia", "results": [{"tool_use_id": "srvtoolu_01LQKTa4JHQyUSrYY6LZNS2W", "content": [{"title": "Apollo 11", "url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Apollo_11"}, {"title": "Apolo 11", "url": "https://www.wikipedia.com/wiki/Apolo_11"}, {"title": "Checked content", "url": "https://solarspell-dls.sfis.asu.edu/mea/wikipedia/wp/a/Apollo_11.htm"}, {"title": "Checked content", "url": "https://kolibri.teacherinabox.org.au/modules/en-wikipedia_for_schools-static/wp/a/Apollo_11.htm"}, {"title": "NEXT SPACEFLIGHT", "url": "https://api.nextspaceflight.com/launches/details/193"}, {"title": "www.slideshare.net", "url": "https://www.slideshare.net/slideshow/apollo-11-115193652/115193652"}, {"title": "Tag Archives: Launch Complex 39A", "url": "https://www.thisdayinaviation.com/tag/launch-complex-39a/page/5/"}, {"title": "Apollo 11", "url": "https://simple.wikipedia.com/wiki/Apollo_11"}, {"title": "apollo 11 saturn v", "url": "https://orbitcodex.com/operations/apollo-11-saturn-v"}, {"title": "apollo 11", "url": "https://spaceodysseyhub.com/missions/apollo-11"}]}, "The search turned up conflicting launch mass figures for Apollo 11, and the English Wikipedia value is the one most likely to be right.\n\n- **English Wikipedia** gives 109,646 lb (49,735 kg) for launch mass. Launch mass: 109,646 lb (49,735 kg)\n- **Simple English Wikipedia** (a mirror at simple.wikipedia.com) gives 100,756 lb (45,702 kg). Launch mass | 100,756 pounds (45,702 kg)\n- **A SlideShare presentation** repeats the 45,702 kg figure. Launch mass :- 100,756 pounds (45,702 kg)\n\nThe figures refer to different things, so they shouldn't be compared directly. The Saturn V rocket's own mass is much larger. One source says the rocket had a fully fueled mass of over 2.9 million kg. A separate source gives the Lunar Module's launch mass as 15,095 kg.\n\nThe 49,735 kg figure from English Wikipedia is the one to cite if you need a single answer. The 45,702 kg figure appears in Simple Wikipedia and in the SlideShare presentation, so the discrepancy is real and I couldn't resolve it from these results."], "durationSeconds": 8.686318167, "searchCount": 1}, "tool_result_meta": [{"id": "toolu_013me9feodTgkgkrTd9qo6i4", "permission_decision": {"decision": "accept", "source": "hook", "reason_type": "hook"}}]}
{"type": "assistant", "message": {"model": "claude-opus-5-5", "id": "msg_011CgDXqqsKhdSZxPBPq5hMJ", "type": "message", "role": "assistant", "content": [{"type": "thinking", "thinking": "", "signature": ""}], "container": null, "stop_reason": null, "stop_sequence": null, "stop_details": null, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 3338, "cache_read_input_tokens": 4309, "cache_creation": {"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 3338}, "output_tokens": 8, "service_tier": "standard", "inference_geo": "global", "speed": "standard"}, "input_transformations": [], "diagnostics": null, "context_management": null}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "timestamp": "2026-10-20T13:01:36.118Z", "request_id": "req_011CgDXqqbDHYJPJNSLGLaKh", "thinking_duration_ms": 7018, "thinking_display": "updates"}
{"type": "assistant", "message": {"model": "claude-opus-5-5", "id": "msg_011CgDXqqsKhdSZxPBPq5hMJ", "type": "message", "role": "assistant", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "**答案：约 47,906 kg**\n\n我用的是英文维基百科信息框里每次任务飞船的\"launch mass\"（发射质量）。这个数字是飞船本身（指令服务舱加登月舱）的质量，不含土星五号火箭：\n\n- Apollo 11：49,735 kg\n- Apollo 12：49,915 kg\n- Apollo 13：44,069 kg（指令服务舱 28,881 kg + 登月舱 15,188 kg）\n\n(49,735 + 49,915 + 44,069) / 3 = 143,719 / 3 ≈ 47,906.33，四舍五入是 **47,906 kg**。\n\n各来源的数字对不上，所以这个答案不太确定：\n- Apollo 13 的数字比另外两次低了约 5,700 kg，统计口径可能不一样，但维基百科没说是不是。\n- 简明英文维基和一些旧镜像给的是另一组数：45,702 / 45,870 / 45,931 kg。用这组算，平均是 **45,834 kg**。\n- 如果题目问的是整枚土星五号火箭加满燃料的质量，那是另一个量，大约 290 万 kg。\n\n我搜了 3 次。\n\nSources:\n- [Apollo 11 – Wikipedia](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Apollo_11)\n- [Apollo 12 – Wikipedia](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Apollo_12)\n- [Apollo 13 – Wikipedia](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Apollo_13)\n- [Apollo 11 – Simple Wikipedia](https://simple.wikipedia.com/wiki/Apollo_11)\n- [Apollo 13 – Simple Wikipedia](https://simple.wikipedia.com/wiki/Apollo_13)\n- [Next Spaceflight – Apollo 12](https://api.nextspaceflight.com/launches/details/194)\n- [NASA Apollo 13 Flight Journal](https://www.nasa.gov/history/afj/ap13fj/01launch_ascent.html)"}], "container": null, "stop_reason": null, "stop_sequence": null, "stop_details": null, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 3338, "cache_read_input_tokens": 4309, "cache_creation": {"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 3338}, "output_tokens": 8, "service_tier": "standard", "inference_geo": "global", "speed": "standard"}, "input_transformations": [], "diagnostics": null, "context_management": null}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "timestamp": "2026-10-20T13:01:36.129Z", "request_id": "req_011CgDXqqbDHYJPJNSLGLaKh"}
